>>>>>>>>> make sense to me.
>>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>>> There are some ways to get around this if you really want to:
>>>>>>>>>> - Draw the text as a path.
>>>>>>>>>> - Use the "render" method on the scene to render to a QPicture,
